{"availability":"available","full":"MengTo/towers","name":"towers","description":"A tower builds itself from the ground up in four and a half seconds: a Japanese tenshu, a Chinese pagoda or a Thai prang, in one self-contained HTML file.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":131,"forks":32,"created":"2026-08-11T05:15:51Z","updated":"2026-08-11T08:16:27Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mengto.github.io/towers/","topics":["architecture","generative","procedural-generation","single-file","threejs","webgl"],"demo":"https://mengto.github.io/towers/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:07:56.596Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:07:56.596Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:07:56.596Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:32:55.019Z","stars":129,"forks":31},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:45.421Z","stars":129,"forks":31},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:29:54.261Z","stars":130,"forks":32},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:07:56.596Z","stars":131,"forks":32}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A tower builds itself from the ground up in four and a half seconds. A cut plane rises through the model and everything below it is finished work — stone, timber, plaster, tile — while the scaffolding waits above the line. Switch the style and the same construction runs as a Japanese tenshu, a Chinese pagoda, a Vietnamese tháp, a Thai prang, a Khmer prasat, or an Ottoman mosque."],"features":["Six towers modelled at the same level of detail: a Japanese tenshu with stone ishigaki base, plastered storeys and flying eaves; a Chinese pagoda in vermilion lacquer and green glaze under a gilt finial; a Vietnamese…","A construction that runs in 4.40 seconds, captioned by stage in the local language and in English — 石垣普請 / STONEWORK, ថ្មភក់ / SANDSTONE, KUBBE / DOME, MÁI NGÓI / TILED EAVES — with a completion percentage set large in…","Drag to orbit the tower, or just move the pointer and the camera leans with it. The wheel zooms from 50% to 200%. Double-click or press C to recentre.","Scrub the timeline at the foot of the page to sit anywhere in the build, or press Space to pause it mid-air.","Four times of day that cross-fade rather than cut — morning, noon, sunset, night — each with its own sun, fog, ground and sky. Night brings out 39,200 stars."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MengTo/towers/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f559f22bde339b04c4c10298c595799f9a256a4c71077f9346f7b5d26d492676","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:07.656Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:45.686Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-11T08:16:27Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:45.689Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:41:32.988Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A tower builds itself from the ground up in four and a half seconds. A cut plane rises through the model and everything below it is finished work — stone, timber, plaster, tile — while the scaffolding waits above the line. Switch the style and the same construction runs as a Japanese tenshu, a Chinese pagoda, a Vietnamese tháp, a Thai prang, a Khmer prasat, or an Ottoman mosque.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MengTo/towers/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f559f22bde339b04c4c10298c595799f9a256a4c71077f9346f7b5d26d492676","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MengTo/towers/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:47:45.686Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MengTo/towers/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T16:58:22.240Z","hash":"f559f22bde339b04c4c10298c595799f9a256a4c71077f9346f7b5d26d492676","originalBytes":12922,"storedBytes":12922,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["what","each","build","rather","tower","one","assets","own","rain","same","six","tile","under","ground","over","scaffolding","through","towers","weather","were","above","camera","construction","cut","dome","four","generated","image","khmer","live","ottoman","plane","set","sky","storm